  unitName: Earth Crystal
  unitId: 30324
  unitNumber: 431
  description: This magical creature is said to systemize and store all Earth-related
    knowledge that Metal Units can hold within them. They seem to be able to communicate
    with Earth Ghosts, who are known for their reticence, solely by gaze. Due to
    that, they attempt to communicate by gaze with others as well, only ever saying
    "It's fine, it's fine. You don't have to say a thing." It has been said that
    gazing into one's eyes instills a sense of recognition and positivity. However,
    there are a few rare rumors saying that they don't really think of anything and
    have no intention of listening to anyone.
  summonDesc: Oh, a Summoner.<br>It's fine, it's fine.<br>You don't have to say a
    thing.
